 -- Explicit rebuild only. Commit the invalidation and epoch together before
 -- any old asynchronous renderer may publish another result. Page files are
 -- retained and reused; no native game cache or texture handles are touched.
 function self:invalidate(keys,expected_generation)
  if expected_generation~=nil and expected_generation~=generation then return nil,'preview generation changed'end
